| Command | v2 behavior (file:line) | Decision | Port surface |
|---|---|---|---|
| provider.connect | DialogIntegration over integration.list; onConnected → models dialog (app.tsx:946-958; component/dialog-integration.tsx:76-146) | WIRE | Integration list → (accounts | method choice) → key prompt / OAuth-code prompt / OAuth-auto+command pending view (o=open URL, c=copy); connect.key/oauth.complete POSTs; "Connected {name}" toast; list+connected refetch. CTA (onboarding card) routes through the same dispatch arm. |
| open.menu | DialogOpen: recent sessions + projects (app.tsx:763-774; component/dialog-open.tsx) | WIRE (session half; project half registered) | Large "Open session or project" over the session.list routing (navigate + open tab) + the open refetch. v2's project/worktree drill-down + cross-project switching is the registered remainder (the port is location-bound: select_worktree ignores the directory — pre-existing). |
| opencode.settings | DialogConfig settings rows, enter/←/→ cycle values via config.update (component/dialog-config.tsx:330-418) | WIRE (subset) | Settings dialog with the FOUR rows this build reads AND persists: Theme (registry cycle + write), Color mode (system/dark/light), Sidebar (hide/auto), Tool grouping (auto/none — closes should-fix #5's grouping half). v2's remaining rows (animations, scrollbar, thinking, markdown, verbosity, tps, image_preview, new_location, permissions, tabs.*, diffs.*, scroll.*, mouse, prompt.*, leader.timeout, attention.*, terminal.*, debug) are rows for state our TUI does not model — omitted rather than shown-not-working (the thinking/scrollbar/verbosity toggles themselves are pre-existing gaps outside this lane's blockers). |
