| session.fork | DialogFork: "Full session" + reversed user messages; select → session.fork(before) → navigate + projected prompt + "Forked session" toast (routes/session/dialog-fork.tsx:29-82) | WIRE | ForkPicker dialog (Large) over the FIXED fork API; result opens the tab, seeds the composer when forking at a user message, toasts. MessageActions' Fork (dialog-message) now forks directly at that message (dialog-fork.tsx:38-40 semantics) — the 7.3 seam note retired. |
| location.reload | toast "Reloading configuration…" → POST location.reload → "Configuration reloaded" / toast.error (app.tsx:1019-1034) | WIRE | Full toast pair + POST through SessionActionSink/loop-fetcher. |
