| session.compact | data.session.compact({model: current}) + clear; error toast (index.tsx:945-968) | WIRE | POST /compact with the current model selection (schema's compact body carries delivery/id; the model rides the session's selection server-side); errors toast. |
| session.undo | last user msg w/ text before revert boundary → interrupt+wait+revert.stage + composer seed; "Nothing to undo" (index.tsx:969-1000) | WIRE | Full chain (worker: interrupt → wait → revert.stage), composer seed, miss toast. MessageActions' Revert now fires the same POST (the "7.3 seam not yet wired" note retired). |
