| session.delete | NOT a palette command in v2 — the sessions dialog's two-press ctrl+d action → session.remove (component/dialog-session-list.tsx:161-166, 255-279; keybind.ts:123) | WIRE as dialog action; never palette | Two-press delete in the Sessions dialog (arm → "Press ctrl+d again to confirm" title → remove POST); onMove disarms; error toast class on failure. The palette never listed it (registry unchanged). |
